- 2026-10-19: The development branch also fixed the age of a rig that never reported (`5e4a7d6`), and part of research on OpenCode's free models (`e8a557b`, `301853e`, `d1d34e8`). The docs pages now describe both, and the tutorials no longer call the planner under OpenCode a known fault.

